    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VHS/PS1 Survival Horror Experience!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/03d829c4ea079fd07b59f57ec4777c03.poster.avif?t=1703282040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/03d829c4ea079fd07b59f57ec4777c03.webm?t=1703282040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/03d829c4ea079fd07b59f57ec4777c03.mp4?t=1703282040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play as <strong>Emilia</strong>, a young woman cursed by an ancient rosary, transported into the Realm of the Inquisitor, an oneiric dimension filled with the ghosts victims of the Inquisitor himself. Solve puzzles, free ghosts, and escape the Inquisitor!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Gameplay</h2>Encounter the <strong>Ghosts</strong> of the Inquisitor's previous victims as you navigate the cursed dimension. You will unlock secrets and items to aid your journey, open new paths, explore new rooms and progress through the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/b482f9315821b3584d651cb4a9ecc723.poster.avif?t=1703282040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/b482f9315821b3584d651cb4a9ecc723.webm?t=1703282040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/b482f9315821b3584d651cb4a9ecc723.mp4?t=1703282040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If The Inquisitor is chasing you, you have three options: run, hide, or stunt him with Holy Water! - you cannot defeat The Inquisitor. He will always come back for you!<br><br>Immerse yourself in a survival horror experience that recreates the atmosphere of classic late 90's. With its tank controls, cinematic third-person camera angles, and controller-based gameplay, this title captures the essence of a bygone era.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Get thrilled by the old school aesthetic of classic Survival Horror.<br></li><li> Experience a rich story about a Female protagonist looking for her lost mother <br></li><li> Listen to an amazing Soundtrack Inspired by Giallo Cinema<br></li><li> Explore the surreal Cursed Realm<br></li><li> Panic when you hear the steps of the Inquisitor behind you!<br></li><li> Enjoy a short but dense rich story game </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VHS/PS1 Survival Horror Experience!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/03d829c4ea079fd07b59f57ec4777c03.poster.avif?t=1703282040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/03d829c4ea079fd07b59f57ec4777c03.webm?t=1703282040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/03d829c4ea079fd07b59f57ec4777c03.mp4?t=1703282040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play as <strong>Emilia</strong>, a young woman cursed by an ancient rosary, transported into the Realm of the Inquisitor, an oneiric dimension filled with the ghosts victims of the Inquisitor himself. Solve puzzles, free ghosts, and escape the Inquisitor!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Gameplay</h2>Encounter the <strong>Ghosts</strong> of the Inquisitor's previous victims as you navigate the cursed dimension. You will unlock secrets and items to aid your journey, open new paths, explore new rooms and progress through the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/b482f9315821b3584d651cb4a9ecc723.poster.avif?t=1703282040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/b482f9315821b3584d651cb4a9ecc723.webm?t=1703282040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2417730/extras/b482f9315821b3584d651cb4a9ecc723.mp4?t=1703282040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If The Inquisitor is chasing you, you have three options: run, hide, or stunt him with Holy Water! - you cannot defeat The Inquisitor. He will always come back for you!<br><br>Immerse yourself in a survival horror experience that recreates the atmosphere of classic late 90's. With its tank controls, cinematic third-person camera angles, and controller-based gameplay, this title captures the essence of a bygone era.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Get thrilled by the old school aesthetic of classic Survival Horror.<br></li><li> Experience a rich story about a Female protagonist looking for her lost mother <br></li><li> Listen to an amazing Soundtrack Inspired by Giallo Cinema<br></li><li> Explore the surreal Cursed Realm<br></li><li> Panic when you hear the steps of the Inquisitor behind you!<br></li><li> Enjoy a short but dense rich story game </li></ul>",
